@startuml get_number_seooc

' Zoom level 0: the SEooC as a black box. get_number_component.puml and
' get_number_unit.puml repeat the call one level deeper.

actor App
participant safety_software_seooc_example <<SEooC>>
participant Platform <<external>>

App -> safety_software_seooc_example : GetNumber()
activate safety_software_seooc_example
safety_software_seooc_example -> Platform : Log()
safety_software_seooc_example --> App : number
deactivate safety_software_seooc_example

@enduml
